package adminweb

// Problem preparation from the browser (R6.2; new): importing a package
// with a preview (prepare_import.go), problem.yaml (prepare_import.go),
// files recognised by name (prepare_files.go), testcases one by one, the
// outputs generated by a reference solution and the inputs generated by a
// generator (prepare_testcases.go), test submissions with a verdict per
// testcase (prepare_submissions.go) and the list of what the task lacks
// (here). The pages use the components of CMS's task page (tables,
// forms, notification boxes).
//
// Running programs uses the judging path that already exists: the test
// submissions and the generation runs are submissions and user tests of a
// hidden, unrestricted participation of a reserved user (prepUsername) in
// the contest of the task, judged by the dispatcher and the workers on
// the datasets that are judged (the live one and those with background
// judging). Test submissions are not official, so they never count for
// the scores. What a generation run is for (the output of a testcase, or
// the input of a new one) is kept in Valkey until its user test finishes;
// the pages of the dataset then store the result (collectGenerated).

